hyprbars: right-aligned buttons from realtime geometry; the button under the pointer takes the accent

bar_buttons_alignment other than "left" uses realtime's right-aligned row (wol_lights_at_w,
wol_lights_over_w, wol_lights_slot_w in wol_realtime.h): close at the right edge, then zoom,
minimise, placed against the bar's own width, so presses and hover agree with what is drawn
(the button in slot i is the i-th added button). "left" keeps wol_lights_at/wol_lights_over.

The button under the pointer is sampled with the glyph state (never while rendering) and drawn
in button_hover_color, in button_pressed_color while a press on it is held; its glyph takes
col.button_hover_text (kept per monitor scale like the other glyphs, redrawn when that colour
changes). 0 means unset for all three; the theme writes them (hypr/wolos/theme.lua).
